LABEL 9831
## Check continue flag
LOAD 1.0 120
EQ 121 96 120
JMP_F 121 9832
LOAD 0.0 96  # clear continue
JMP 981      # re-evaluate condition
LABEL 9832
JMP 981

LABEL 982
RET

